  "structural_change": "Ordinary PC structural replacement for the old hold-repair loop: complete ck/hck domains with canonical physical clock-pin dedup, exact unique owner verification, bounded physical leaves, equal stage budgets and same-depth SRAM drivers. Source payload and existing group landing ABI unchanged; no new data edge or domain."
