 "structural_change": "KVPC-R 10-23 r3b: COORD-review redesign of qkd_kvs_pc (sr15f geometry: 23 SRAMs gridded, pins away from logic, 13% fill / 61% empty). One macro bank (2 abutted back-to-back stacks of 12 R0 + 11 MY arrays at x 64.8), PHY band W of the bank faces column A (front/return/tq), main band E faces column B (ecdc); outline 302.4 x 356.4 (pin-bound; o_grp N -> E); chain pins abutment-aligned N/S (FT-KV); RTL = sr13a byte-identical (every live pin flop-direct: 0 cycles). ALT: 302.4 wide (N/S 4.1-4.2 /um), PHY band 63 um.",
